---
id: repo.review-security
title: Review Security
category: security
stage: [analyze, discover, inspect, validate, report]
purpose: Evaluate a bounded system or change against explicit security objectives, threats, controls, and evidence.
inputs: [security_scope, security_objectives, threat_context]
outputs: [security_findings, control_evidence, residual_risk]
mutates_repository: false
requires_validation: true
